[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911595807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106829#issuecomment-2911595807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106829","id":2911595807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ti20f","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T08:13:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T08:13:16Z","body":"That seems fine as a stopgap for pathological case, with a higher threshold.\r\n\r\nBut I still think we're missing some caching potential there and probably run a lot of unnecessary logic.\r\n\r\nI see we already have:\r\n```cpp\r\nRef<Texture2D> EditorData::get_script_icon(const String &p_script_path) {\r\n\t// Take from the local cache, if available.\r\n\tif (_script_icon_cache.has(p_script_path)) {\r\n\t\t// Can be an empty value if we can't resolve any icon for this script.\r\n\t\t// An empty value is still cached to avoid unnecessary attempts at resolving it again.\r\n\t\treturn _script_icon_cache[p_script_path];\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo that should be reasonably fast. But there are still several steps running before reaching `EditorData::get_script_icon` starting from `EditorNode::get_class_icon`.\r\n\r\nWe should maybe have a cache in `EditorNode::get_class_icon` to avoid unnecessarily running a ton of logic to retrieve script paths or extensions or whatnot for a global class identifier we already evaluated one frame ago.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911595807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912325464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106829#issuecomment-2912325464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106829","id":2912325464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tlo9Y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T12:27:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T12:27:34Z","body":"I opened #106866","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"u